#ASSERT `How much weekly compensation do I get this week` 29 FALSE FALSE 1600 0 1680 600 TRUE 2 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 `AWE` EQUALS `How much weekly compensation must I pay this worker this week` 29 FALSE FALSE 1600 0 1680 600 TRUE 2 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 `AWE`
#ASSERT `How much weekly compensation do I get this week` 260 FALSE FALSE 1600 0 1680 600 TRUE 2 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 `AWE` EQUALS `How much weekly compensation must I pay this worker this week` 260 FALSE FALSE 1600 0 1680 600 TRUE 2 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 `AWE`
-- Until when.
#ASSERT `Until when will my weekly compensation be paid` (`the calendar date` 15 6 1985) (`the calendar date` 2 3 2026) 804 780 FALSE EQUALS `Until when must I pay this worker's weekly compensation` (`the calendar date` 15 6 1985) (`the calendar date` 2 3 2026) 804 780 FALSE
-- The lump sum at 10% and at 85%, and when it is due.
#ASSERT `How much do I get for my permanent impairment` 10 `AWE` EQUALS `What permanent impairment compensation must I pay this worker` 10 `AWE`
#ASSERT `How much do I get for my permanent impairment` 85 `AWE` EQUALS `What permanent impairment compensation must I pay this worker` 85 `AWE`
#ASSERT `By when must my permanent impairment compensation be paid` (`the calendar date` 1 10 2026) TRUE (`the calendar date` 10 12 2026) EQUALS `By when must I pay this worker's permanent impairment compensation` (`the calendar date` 1 10 2026) TRUE (`the calendar date` 10 12 2026)
-- The claim deadlines.
