-- Deemed acceptance: disputed on 20 March without the statement (not deemed, s 85(8) unmet, finding 18).
#ASSERT `Is my employer taken to have accepted my claim` (`the calendar date` 9 3 2026) 0 TRUE (`the calendar date` 20 3 2026) `dispute liability, without the s 85(8) statement` FALSE (`the calendar date` 20 3 2026) (`the calendar date` 24 3 2026) EQUALS `Am I taken to have accepted this claim` (`the calendar date` 9 3 2026) 0 TRUE (`the calendar date` 20 3 2026) `dispute liability, without the s 85(8) statement` FALSE (`the calendar date` 20 3 2026) (`the calendar date` 24 3 2026)
-- When a deemed acceptance ends: acceptance notified 27 March; a dispute without the statement on 27 March.
#ASSERT `Until when is my employer taken to have accepted my claim` `accept liability` (`the calendar date` 27 3 2026) EQUALS `Until when am I taken to have accepted this claim` `accept liability` (`the calendar date` 27 3 2026)
#ASSERT `Until when is my employer taken to have accepted my claim` `dispute liability, without the s 85(8) statement` (`the calendar date` 27 3 2026) EQUALS `Until when am I taken to have accepted this claim` `dispute liability, without the s 85(8) statement` (`the calendar date` 27 3 2026)
