#ASSERT `Would my employer commit an offence by dismissing me` TRUE FALSE (`the calendar date` 2 3 2026) (`the calendar date` 3 9 2026) EQUALS `Would dismissing this worker be an offence` TRUE FALSE (`the calendar date` 2 3 2026) (`the calendar date` 3 9 2026)
